    "prompt": "Use case: game-terrain atlas. Create18 NEW Mindustry ground surfaces, detailed bright Daoist Q hand-painted material art harmonizing with attached jade/ivory/warm-gold UI craftsmanship. Pure flat TOP-DOWN ORTHOGRAPHIC textures only: no UI controls, text, people, weapons or decorative emblems. Requested1536×3072 portrait, exactly3 equal columns×6 equal rows square fullbleed swatches, no gutters/frames/labels. Opaque. Each cell uniform light, no gradient/vignette, tileable edges.\nRow1 all3 REDMAT variants: muted dark red-brown soil densely covered by small red clay-like curled alien plant threads embedded flat in ground, three independent distributions, tiny shapes not giant roots.\nRow2 all3 BLUEMAT variants: muted dark bluish-purple soil with tiny violet-blue curled alien organic threads embedded flat, three independent distributions.\nRow3 left METAL FLOOR1 satin jade-gray square metal plate with small restrained warm-gold corner rivets; middle METAL FLOOR2 warm ivory-gray small tiled metal plates with delicate seams; right METAL FLOOR3 cool green-gray striped narrow metal planks with sparse gold fasteners.\nRow4 left METAL FLOOR4 muted dark-teal diamond mesh metal floor; middle METAL FLOOR5 sage-gray metal with fine crossing support braces; right DAMAGED METAL1 weathered jade-gray plates with subtle scratches and one chipped corner.\nRow5 left DAMAGED METAL2 different worn jade-gray plate arrangement with a fine cracked seam; middle DAMAGED METAL3 worn brushed gray metal with small dents/scuffs; right CORE ZONE pale sandy-beige reinforced landing pad tile, subtle warm gold corner brackets with center clear, no symbols/letters.\nRow6 all3 DARK PANEL floor variants: 1 dark charcoal-teal rectangular metal plating; 2 dark charcoal-teal diamond grip surface; 3 dark charcoal-teal fine parallel vent slats. Tiny warm gold accents only, mechanical ground materials, not UI panels.\nRefined handpainted soft edges and clear small-scale structural detail. Exact18cells no typography.",
